1
00:00:03,082 --> 00:00:06,264
Noah cuts a hard-boiled egg: shell, white, yolk.

2
00:00:06,314 --> 00:00:09,160
And under our feet, what is the Earth like?

3
00:00:09,210 --> 00:00:09,631
Hollow?

4
00:00:09,681 --> 00:00:10,557
Full of lava?

5
00:00:11,330 --> 00:00:12,548
Mila digs and digs…

6
00:00:12,598 --> 00:00:13,216
one meter!

7
00:00:13,266 --> 00:00:14,617
But the center of the

8
00:00:14,667 --> 00:00:17,154
Earth is six thousand kilometers down.

9
00:00:17,204 --> 00:00:18,405
Not with a shovel!

10
00:00:19,182 --> 00:00:20,696
Discovery mission!

11
00:00:23,212 --> 00:00:23,797
Mini mode!

12
00:00:23,847 --> 00:00:26,021
First the crust, thin like a shell.

13
00:00:26,071 --> 00:00:30,025
Then the mantle: three thousand kilometers of burning-hot rock,

14
00:00:30,075 --> 00:00:31,790
so hot it is almost melted.

15
00:00:32,560 --> 00:00:36,358
At the center, the core, made of iron and nickel: liquid outside,

16
00:00:36,408 --> 00:00:40,079
and that is what makes the magnetic field; solid at the heart.

17
00:00:40,862 --> 00:00:41,716
How do we know?

18
00:00:41,766 --> 00:00:45,390
Thanks to earthquakes: their waves travel through the planet,

19
00:00:45,440 --> 00:00:47,739
and the liquid core stops some of them.

20
00:00:47,789 --> 00:00:49,114
An X-ray of the Earth!

21
00:00:49,912 --> 00:00:53,858
Curio, in mini mode, floats at the edge of the core:

22
00:00:53,908 --> 00:00:56,010
molten metal turning slowly.

23
00:00:56,060 --> 00:00:57,213
Quick, back up!

24
00:00:57,994 --> 00:01:00,323
That's what is hidden inside the Earth.

25
00:01:01,491 --> 00:01:04,436
Under the crust, a mantle of burning-hot rock,

26
00:01:04,486 --> 00:01:07,611
then an iron core: liquid outside, solid inside.

27
00:01:08,402 --> 00:01:10,976
With an adult: cut a hard-boiled egg.

28
00:01:11,026 --> 00:01:14,238
The shell is the crust; the white, the mantle;

29
00:01:14,288 --> 00:01:17,622
the yolk, the core, which really has two parts!

30
00:01:18,382 --> 00:01:20,543
And why do volcanoes erupt?

31
00:01:20,593 --> 00:01:22,231
The answer tomorrow.
